<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Basically this macro takes advantage of roblox's . and / keys that tilt the camera angle 45 degrees to the left and right. With the right delay time, you can do a wallhop by just pressing w and space and assigning the macro to left click for example</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 54 1
KeyUp 54 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyDown 55 1
KeyUp 55 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>